        "id": 1125984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-05-09T17:53:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So kind of what Nathan was suggesting and adding an element of randomness? If we vary the holdoff period, we *should* only run into 1 collision at most? (I don\u0027t think other devices do this.)",
      "parentUuid": "a805a605_f30dfe66",
