      "writtenOn": "2019-05-09T18:57:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For whatever it\u0027s worth, this fix as it is does help with one of our octopus OEM hubs we\u0027ve had problems with (b/123326737).  However, varying the holdoff period would probably be a good general approach in order to reduce the probability of repeated collisions.",
